#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md:36
#: 8d652a2742c14b82bc68dd53dc50c42c
msgid ""
"`arms_controller_common` also implements **MoveJ** (`StateMoveJ`) and "
"`FSMCommandPublisher`, which publishes **`std_msgs/Int32`** on "
"`/fsm_command` (values in that header: `1` HOME, `2` HOLD, `3` OCS2, `4` "
"MOVEJ). On mixed OCS2/WBC stacks, `basic_joint_controller` treats `3` as "
"OCS2 and `4` as MOVEJ — see "
"[basic_joint_controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md)."
msgstr ""
"`arms_controller_common` 还实现 **MoveJ**（`StateMoveJ`）和 `FSMCommandPublisher`，后者向 `/fsm_command` 发布 **`std_msgs/Int32`**（该头文件中的值：`1` HOME，`2` HOLD，`3` OCS2，`4` MOVEJ）。在混合 OCS2/WBC 栈上，`basic_joint_controller` 把 `3` 当作 OCS2、`4` 当作 MOVEJ — 见 [basic_joint_controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md)。"

